# ForgeQA - User Discovery Analysis

> **Project Status: Pre-alpha**
> **Version**: 0.1.0
> **Last Updated**: 2026-10-27
> **Owner**: Solo Developer
> **Based on**: Interviews U-001 to U-008 (see `docs/user-discovery.md`)

---

## 1. Executive Summary

> This document synthesizes the raw qualitative data from Phase 0.2 user interviews into quantifiable themes. It identifies the most frequent and impactful pain points, providing the evidence needed to prioritise the MVP scope (Phase 0.3).

**Key Finding**: The most frequently cited pain point was **Setup Friction (T-01)**, mentioned by **7 of 8** interviewees, with an estimated impact of **1–2 days of lost setup time per project**. This will be the primary focus of the MVP.

**Secondary Finding**: **Diagnostic Gaps (T-02)** were mentioned by **6 of 8** interviewees, with an estimated impact of **3–5 hours per week of investigation time**. This will be the secondary focus of the MVP.

